                <p>Source: Transmits a study by interdepartmental study group on “U.S. and Allied
                    Capabilities for Limited Military Operations to 1 July 1962.” Top Secret.
                    Extracts—11 pp. Eisenhower Library, Records of the Office of the Special
                    Assistant to President for National Security Affairs, Limited Military
                    Operations.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
